              "value": "Fungal Web"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The canopy elder launches a rapidly growing net of fungus from the mushrooms growing on its body at a single creature within 80 feet. The target must attempt a 39 Reflex save or become restrained by the fungal web (Escape 39). While restrained, the creature takes 4d6 poison damage at the end of each of their turns."
